<div class="pschat" id="pschat" data-workshop="true"><h2>Tool Workshop</h2><p>Create and test read-only tools, or propose a fixed maintenance action for owner approval.</p>
<div class="pschat-panel"><label>Local model <select id="psc-model"><option>Connecting…</option></select></label> <button id="psc-refresh" class="btn btn-default">Refresh connection</button> <button id="psc-reset" class="btn btn-default">New conversation</button><p id="psc-status" role="status">Loading…</p><div id="psc-tools"><strong>Data access for the next question</strong><div class="psc-toolrow"><label><input type="checkbox" value="report" checked> Latest report</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="devices"> Device activity</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="health"> System health</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="privacy"> Privacy counters</label><label><input type="checkbox" value="live"> Recent visible packets</label></div></div></div>
<div id="psc-history" class="pschat-panel" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="pschat-panel"><label for="psc-prompt">Describe the tool or maintenance task</label><textarea id="psc-prompt" maxlength="1500" rows="3" placeholder="Is my TV sending tracking requests? Explain in plain English."></textarea><div class="psc-toolrow"><button id="psc-send" class="btn btn-primary">Test analysis</button><button id="psc-propose" class="btn btn-default">Create a reusable tool</button><button id="psc-draft" class="btn btn-default">Draft Python tool</button><a href="pishield-chat" class="btn btn-default">Open Chat</a></div><p>Reusable tools combine the approved read-only sources and your analysis instructions. Review before saving. No generated code runs.</p><div id="psc-proposal"></div><hr><h3>AI Interface Design</h3><p>Describe a color, layout density, card shape or text size in the prompt above. Preview the result before saving it for all dashboard users.</p><button id="psc-design" class="btn btn-primary">Propose design</button><button id="psc-theme-reset" class="btn btn-default">Restore original theme</button><div id="psc-design-result"></div><hr><h3>Permission for maintenance proposals</h3><label>Permission <select id="psc-mode"><option value="read">Read-only (default)</option><option value="admin">Administrator — fixed service/list operations</option><option value="root">Supervised root — fixed package operations</option></select></label><button id="psc-action" class="btn btn-default" disabled>Propose maintenance action</button><p>Actions do not run from the browser. Review the exact operation and approve separately via SSH. Proposals expire after 10 minutes.</p><div id="psc-admin"></div><div id="psc-receipt"></div><div id="psc-recipes"></div></div></div>
<script defer src="<?=webhome?>scripts/js/pishield-chat.js?v=210"></script>
